{"games":[{"id":90652512740562,"name":"Plague [Alpha]","desc":"🧟‍♂️This is a CHAOTIC INFECTION GAME. You have a high chance of dying and becoming a zombie. It's part of the experience.\n\n🔨 GAME IS IN BETA - Bugs might happen sometimes, we are working daily to patch any bugs that come up.\n\nSurvivors: Find weapons, build defenses, work together, and stay alive until the round is over.\nZombies: Kill the survivors, use insane abilities, and grow the zombie horde until no humans remain. \n\n🖥️ PC Controls (you can adjust keybinds in settings)\n- CTRL to Shiftlock \n- SHIFT to sprint / again to stop sprinting \n- Press 5 to open build hotbar, and again to go back to weapon hotbar\n\n🎟️ USE CODE: PARASITEUPDATE for free zombie rolls!\n\n⚠️ WARNING: Any form of exploiting leads to a permanent ban, without any chance for appeal. Abusing glitches is also prohibited. ","path":"/game/90652512740562-plague-alpha","slug":"90652512740562-plague-alpha","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-0813f9e5aceeb27402df319a29d8b918/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2b77a52e07960a3672c361d110344c90/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":8264414,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-01-05T02:18:31.238Z","creator":{"name":"Plague Game","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":91819941310461,"name":"Slap Legends [QUEST UPD]","desc":"Welcome to SLAP LEGENDS! 💪🔥 \n\nNEW CODE: ARENA\n\n🏋️‍♂️ Train your arms, legs, and core to max strength!\n🌎 Become a giant and rule the gym like a true champ!\n💥 Uncover secrets and fight to save the world!\n⚡️ Slap fight gives more STR !\n\n🏷️ tags ; slap fight , gym game , strongest game , strength game , power , league , legend , gym","path":"/game/91819941310461-slap-legends-quest-upd","slug":"91819941310461-slap-legends-quest-upd","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-ed0315679534e6602bc9b0c8004ed9d7/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbx